name: "gsc-utils"
description:
    "gsc-utils is a library that contains tools used to interact with the GSC "
    "on ChromeOS devices. Of most significance is gsctool, which allows users "
    "to disable FW write protect on their devices without the usage of "
    "special hardware. This allows users to flash custom firmware on the "
    "device, and is used extensively across all of ChromeOS to debug and "
    "develop devices."

